    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just a moment of rest i need, kael. it's the whole thing. the cycle. the noise. it's like... no matter what i do, the city just swallows everything up. i feel like there's no version of this where i actually find peace. everything just feels so hollow. like i'm already gone, just waiting for my body to catch up.",
